License notes

Copyright 2026 was a busy year for Acme and its many contributors.

Intended path LICENSE -> cfg mode (cpat IS active here). MANDATORY rev2 control:
a YEAR-BEARING prose line that clears the required-year discriminator but is NOT
an authorship claim. The name-run-to-EOL anchor ([A-Z]...\s*$) fails because the
capitalized "Acme" is followed by lowercase " and its many...", so the run breaks
before end-of-line. cpat returns None -> ALLOW (no false-block on year-prose).
